<title>UK: LME suspends Piraeus as delivery point.</title>
<headline>LME suspends Piraeus as delivery point.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has suspended deliveries of warrantable metal into Piraeus, Greece, until further notice.</p>
<p>In a notice to members the LME said this was because of continuing problems with EU VAT and insurance matters. --London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
